<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">stow</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">stow</ansi> command dumps all of your crafting
components into storage in one step. It only moves crafting materials
(everything in your component bag, plus any loose components in your
backpack) and leaves your gear, consumables, and quest items alone.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">stow</ansi> - Deposit every crafting component
  into this room's storage

You must be standing at a storage location to use it. For selective
deposits or full control over what goes in and out, use the
<ansi fg="command">storage</ansi> command instead
(<ansi fg="command">help storage</ansi>).
